# Glowberry

- Canonical docs live under `docs/`: BRIEF (with its decisions log), POWER, MATERIALS, SCANNING, FABLABS, INFLATABLE, RESEARCH. Start from `AGENTS.md`.
- Private material (applications, named people, correspondence) lives in the private studio repo; never copy it here.
- Do not invent permissions, quotes, or funding facts. No site outreach is sent before the pitch package exists.
- Media (meshes, renders, Blender files, photos, moodboards) goes to the project's Drive folder (`MEDIA_DIR`), not into git. The provenance scan in `models/provenance/` is the one tracked binary.
- `sketchpad/` is scratch; only its README is tracked.
- No phase dates in docs; dates live on issues.
- Dual license: CC BY-NC 4.0 (docs/creative), MIT (software). See LICENSE.md.
- Avoid the word "master" in new user-facing text, docs, comments, and identifiers.
